OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 1 MAR
OL,4,G1700FThe Early Music Show
OL,5,     GHannah French visits St Paul's
OL,6,     GCathedral in London to explore
OL,7,     Gthe legacy of composer John Blow,
OL,8,     Gwho became master of the
OL,9,     Gchoristers at the newly
OL,10,     Gconsecrated cathedral in 1687.
OL,11,G1800FWords and Music
OL,12,     GFictional robots and poetic
OL,13,     Gautomata alongside music created
OL,14,     Gby and played by machines. With
OL,15,     Greadings from Annette Badland and
OL,16,     GDaniel Millar.
