OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 1 MAR
OL,4,G1915FSunday Feature: Bartok and Us
OL,5,     GThe comedian, actor and keen
OL,6,     Gamateur musician Nick Mohammed
OL,7,     Greports on the first British
OL,8,     Gencounters with the music of
OL,9,     GHungarian Bela Bartok and how our
OL,10,     Gattitudes changed over time.
OL,11,G2000FDvorak String Quintet Op.97
OL,12,     GThe Building a Library
OL,13,     Grecommended recording from
OL,14,     Gyesterday's Record Review.
OL,15,G2100F20th Century Radicals
OL,16,     GKate Molleson and Gillian Moore
OL,17,     Gshine new light on the 'modern'
OL,18,     Gmusic of the 20th century. This
OL,19,     Gweek, Gillian explores the music
OL,20,     Gof the Dutch radical Louis
OL,21,     GAndriessen.
